pbwinput 1
# The starter save, made on the oracle from first_save's (oracle.py save first_save --version w2_us): CONTINUE as the
# continue sequence presses it, then the story from the player's room to the starter at the Aspertia City lookout, and
# the field menu's SAVE. The save holds Tepig (level 5) in the party and the Pokedex: event flags 0x961 and 0x962, the
# city's story variable 0x40a1 at 4, before Hugh's battle (res/field/scripts/aspertia_city.s, Script_33 and
# Script_8). Positions are zone (x, z) tiles; counts are GFL's frame count (sVBlankCount). On game frames. White 2:
# Black 2's route (starter_save_b2_us.pbwinput) to (41,751), then up x = 40, where Black 2's goes west to x = 37 and up
# there. In White 2 the townsperson who wanders around (36,747) (res/field/events/aspertia_city.json, npc 11, movement
# 3) steps into x = 37 in front of the player, who stands some 30 frames, so every timed walk after it ends short and
# the player is left in front of the Trainers' School without a Pokemon. x = 40 is out of that walker's reach and eight
# tiles shorter; the presses from the stairs on are Black 2's, 124 frames sooner.
version w2_us
1100 START  # START in the opening skips it to the title (count 1115 on both)
1101 -
